{"articleNo":"1316","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1316&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010-2학기 금오공과대학교 교수초빙 공개강의심사 대상자 조회 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.07.21","hit":"9938","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><font size=\"3\"><br></font><strong><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#3366ff\">2010-2학기 금오공과대학교 교수초빙<br>공개강의심사 대상자 조회 안내</font><br></font></strong></p>\n<p align=\"left\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;○ 조회내용 : 기초 및 전공심사 결과[=공개강의 대상자]<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;○ 조회기간 : 2010.7.21(수) ~ 7.27(화)&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;○ 행정사항<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;공개강의대상자로 선정되신 분은 해당 학부(과) 및 전공에서<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;공개강의 진행에 대한 세부계획을 별도로 연락 조치할 계획임을<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;알려드립니다.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#339966\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<u><a href=\"http://kitin.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\">공개강의심사 대상자 조회 바로가기</a></u></font></strong></font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
